\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3229'>\n\t\t\t\tNeil (W6FOG&#8217;s) Geo Tracker all set for mobile emergency communications\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3230\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.52.29-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3230'>\n\t\t\t\tHere&#8217;s Mark on his electric recumbent bike\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3231\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-16.54.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3231'>\n\t\t\t\tAnother shot of Mark on his bike (It folds up too!)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Check out this short video of our trip to Quartzfest 2017<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/s543xH9rFu4\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>We&#8217;ll have subsequent posts of our day trip to Lake Havasu and Parker Dam along with a post about the Big RV show at Quartzsite.<\/p>\n<p>We\u2019d really appreciate it if you would do us the favor of helping us continue to publish this RV \/ Travel \/ Workamping blog. \u00a0<strong>Do you purchase any products from Amazon?<\/strong> \u00a0If you do, it would be great if you\u2019d use the link in the sidebar or one of the links below to get to Amazon \u2026 after that you can change your search. \u00a0By making your Amazon purchases from our site, we will receive from Amazon a small percentage of your purchase and it doesn\u2019t cost you any more. \u00a0We\u2019d really appreciate your help.<\/p>\n<p>Thank you,<\/p>\n<p>Herb &amp; Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>There were two reasons for our trip to Quartzsite, AZ this past week. \u00a0The first was because we were so close (3+ hours) drive time from there we just HAD to see what everyone has been going to see and do for so many years, (The big Vacation, Sports, and RV Show). Then I found &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/31\/quartzfest-ham-radio-convention-in-the-sanoran-desert\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Quartzfest &#8211; Ham Radio Convention In The Sanoran Desert<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","pin